// - Phase 3: normal CloseSpanIfComplete + ConstrainedStep loop (up to 100 steps).
// - Phase 4: CloseSpanWithinBudget with all remaining budget to fix any open span.
// - Phase 5: If no span detected, continue free gen to 90% budget.
// - Phase 6-8: re-enter constrained with EOS penalty, normal loop, final close.
// - Phase 9: Force open a span if still nothing, penalized constrained, close.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
